cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the technical report and the archived repository release."
title: "Exact Determination of the Binary Covering-Sequence Length L(12,3)"
type: software
abstract: "Two independently written exhaustive programs exclude every positive binary cyclic sequence length from 1 through 35 for window length 12 and Hamming radius 3. They check 68,719,476,734 raw sequences through 506,526,514 rotation-reversal-complement representatives and find no cover. An attributed 36-bit construction is independently verified, establishing L(12,3) = 36."
